00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:38.246
I hate Vietnam. Lily, honey, we don't hate.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:41.958
I hate Vietnam.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.044
Okay, We need just a second.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.504
Lily, that was rude. I want to go home.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:51.217
No, it's important that you celebrate
the culture of your ancestors.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.011
You are Vietnamese.

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.346
No, I'm not. I'm gay. I'm gay.

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:57.390
Honey, no, you're not gay.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.226
You are just confused. Oh, my God.
What is wrong with me?

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.603
It's like, Oh, please.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:05.273
We have tons of lesbian friends that you
would reference our friends and not us.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:06.024
Also gay.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:06.483
We should just go. No, Nobody's
going anywhere

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:07.776
We should just go. No, nobody's
going anywhere

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.527
until she finishes the whole soup.

00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:10.445
Gloria, it's fine.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.696
No, no, it's not fine.

00:01:11.696 --> 00:01:13.448
That's the problem with this country.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.116
Nobody cares where they come from.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:17.744
They just want cheeseburgers
and bread, school.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.038
