that's possibly not at all about Lily.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.422
I think you're right.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:33.551
It's just that I feel like
I'm losing my children to America.

00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:38.098
They're just going to grow up
and become boring old white people.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.850
Most of our friends are white, actually.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:45.021
Okay, can everybody just calm down
and go back to their own conversations?

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.856
Just. Thank you.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.733
There you are. Okay. Where's Dylan?

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:50.193
