00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:24.644
Nothing. It can wait.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.938
No, it can't. Please.

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:27.939
My organs are shutting down. 

00:02:27.939 --> 00:02:31.025
Okay, fine. I.

