00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:44.372
You're pregnant? Yes.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.459
We're really happy about it.

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:51.296
Why wouldn't you be? Wow.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.424
Mom?
It's...

00:02:54.424 --> 00:02:57.719
It's a lot to process at once, and -- 

