You handled it a lot better than I did
back in the day.

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:15.778
Ohh. Outside, on the inside I’m you.

00:03:15.778 --> 00:03:17.614
Can somebody save my life?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.824
Oh, yeah. Cam, grab a foot. 
Yep!

00:03:20.408 --> 00:03:22.994
Phil and Claire, as godparents

