00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:31.427
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Okay.

00:08:31.427 --> 00:08:34.639
All right, Perfect.

00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:35.264
I got it.

00:08:35.264 --> 00:08:37.725
[Laughter]

00:08:37.725 --> 00:08:40.603
Oh, I kind of don't want to let go.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:41.395
Yeah, me neither.

00:08:42.813 --> 00:08:45.775
I mean it’s Mitch and Cam now, but

00:08:46.609 --> 00:08:48.903
It’s these three next

00:08:49.403 --> 00:08:52.031
Who knows when we will all be together again.

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:53.074
Why is this so hard?

00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:55.868
We've done this, like, seven times already
today.

00:08:56.285 --> 00:08:59.247
It's hard because not
everybody gets to have what we had.

00:09:00.122 --> 00:09:04.460
Oh, Mitchell,
I put the skating trophy in your suitcase

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.547
I want you to have it first so that I know
