00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.466
Okay, um..

00:09:10.967 --> 00:09:13.636
I'm going to set an example
to be the first one to let go.

00:09:16.973 --> 00:09:18.474
It was awful.

00:09:21.435 --> 00:09:24.313
Life is full of change.

00:09:24.605 --> 00:09:28.442
Some big, some small.

00:09:28.442 --> 00:09:31.696
I learned a long time ago.
You can fight it.

00:09:31.696 --> 00:09:34.323
You can try to make the best of it.

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:41.455
And that's all a lot easier
if you've got people

00:09:41.455 --> 00:09:44.917
